    {
      "title": "Structure and components",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "The Terraform and Pulumi import notes warn that third-party notifications do not contain their sensitive credentials. To update those notifications without the original credentials, the corresponding `notifier_id` (Terraform) or `notifierId` (Pulumi) must be provided. (medium confidence)",
          "source": "https://registry.terraform.io/providers/mongodb/mongodbatlas/latest/docs/resources/alert_configuration",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:9b75dd2121fc8ba72063e1341cb4513d32914506b3ed7604c835db3facf5054a",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:2a1ff1589071861ecbf993c29021f80fa664da086daf3812fb21be84dab6d966",
            "ev:92278d91b6332084cd7f187c3f6477e010ec5598ca5b59db221cd0c7d0e4bde2"
          ],
          "also": [
            "https://www.pulumi.com/registry/packages/mongodbatlas/api-docs/alertconfiguration/"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "How it works",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "The provider changelog records a 2.8.0 fix, dated March 11, 2026, for errors when updating alert notifications, thresholds, or metric thresholds without specifying all optional attributes. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://github.com/mongodb/terraform-provider-mongodbatlas/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:41ce243fb9c0131708e3593e97eedcdf3ad237eec5750669c8dab66c0c2705e2",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:dd975f76c0c9f7017b9ee44f16cb4006fcbbeaa540cd40449f15df14e5e2a8f6"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For Terraform provider v2.8.0, the alert read implementation removes the resource from Terraform state when its not-found check succeeds. A successful read converts the returned alert into the refreshed Terraform state. (medium confidence)",
          "source": "https://api.github.com/repos/mongodb/terraform-provider-mongodbatlas/git/tags/e49de3204be1e2b47776c33e6b8833ae358f7de1",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:48d6a028726a5b8337077ed5df0322eddf22ff59fad61992260c0b36ff8cf9be",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
