            "ev:7b32b46ccc34a3379506465fa6414611a6bd90294410d528a38c2bedfa6733b9"
          ],
          "also": [
            "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mongodb/terraform-provider-mongodbatlas/v2.8.0/internal/service/alertconfiguration/resource.go"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Problems, failure modes and limitations",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Release attribution differs: the maintainer closing issue 305 said its fix was included in 0.7.0, while the changelog lists the billing-alert deletion failure under v0.8.0-pre.1 in its fixed-bugs section. (medium confidence)",
          "source": "https://github.com/mongodb/terraform-provider-mongodbatlas/issues/305",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:90f717836b66d7b672f19a40aa6d73a1863ca1747398e8ef5ab30cbf20c8193f",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:4a56b5b59922575a94dc32ab1f55d94550436825b96cae79f82d4e35948620fc",
            "ev:e40f168a188b01044c44a47dbfc891d3a2d44994a9fa73ddea0828ac2be1aa12"
          ],
          "also": [
            "https://github.com/mongodb/terraform-provider-mongodbatlas/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Terraform provider v2.8.0 alert update implementation reads the existing alert, removes computed group and timestamp values from the request, copies changed enablement, event, matcher, and threshold values, rebuilds notifications, and submits an update for the existing alert identity. The implementation comment explains that the original alert configuration is needed to avoid a server error. (medium confidence)",
          "source": "https://api.github.com/repos/mongodb/terraform-provider-mongodbatlas/git/tags/e49de3204be1e2b47776c33e6b8833ae358f7de1",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:a9ecd7ed9f60c4ba73dec2842fd6efd2089f828688ec711711cb34839c814989",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:5b9c7cf1cb185b4abe6fa2d0a0037900596345737ec232052d5f35e9ed3bee92",
            "ev:885129751c1d325204a3b1f8fc24d66696826c1172c55d8227eeb0683831c7ce"
          ],
          "also": [
            "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mongodb/terraform-provider-mongodbatlas/v2.8.0/internal/service/alertconfiguration/resource.go"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The released v0.7.0 alert read implementation handles an error containing `404` for an existing resource by clearing its Terraform identity and returning successfully. The audited v0.6.4, v0.6.5, and v0.6.6 implementations instead return the read error directly. This release-bound comparison supports the issue closure's v0.7.0 attribution, while the separately preserved changelog listing under v0.8.0-pre.1 remains a different attribution; the comparison does not establish a first fix across all earlier releases. (medium confidence)",
          "source": "https://api.github.com/repos/mongodb/terraform-provider-mongodbatlas/git/matching-refs/tags/v0.6",
          "note": null,
