          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Pulumi v4.18.1 source checkout pins its upstream MongoDB Terraform-provider submodule to commit d589548ae439bc8efb734220b222138d379cf6e4, the commit targeted by the annotated Terraform provider v2.20.1 tag. Its provider module replaces the Terraform-provider dependency with the local upstream checkout. This establishes the source version relationship, without establishing the version used by any deployment. (medium confidence)",
